  "<strong>{0}</strong>, Stufe {1}, Spieltag {2}<br>{3} Gold, {4} Erfahrung, {5} Waldkämpfe übrig, {6} Drachenkills<br><span class=\"muted\">gespeichert {7}</span>": "<strong>{0}</strong>, level {1}, game day {2}<br>{3} gold, {4} experience, {5} forest fights left, {6} dragon kills<br><span class=\"muted\">saved {7}</span>",
